{"seq":2,"slug":"carrier-abstraction","title":"多承运商接入抽象与比价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/carrier-routing/carrier-abstraction","wordCount":2912,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"多承运商接入抽象与比价\">多承运商接入抽象与比价</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一家跨境电商同时合作几十家承运商是常态：境内头程有 3-5 家、国际干线有 5-10 家、目的国尾程每个国家 3-5 家、清关代理若干。若为每一家写一套对接代码，你会得到一个 N 倍复杂度、且 N 每次增加都要重测的系统。承运商抽象层的任务，是让「接入第 31 家承运商」变成一次纯粹的配置工作，而不是一次需要理解全链路的开发任务。</p>\n<p>抽象的核心是一个<strong>内部承运商模型</strong>，它与任何一家的 API 都不同，是取它们交集之上加一层能力的模型。这个模型要能表达：运单创建与取消、运价查询、时效查询、面单获取、轨迹查询与推送、能力声明（带电/液体/超尺寸/签收凭证/保价）、以及结算对账。前六项是操作，能力声明是元数据，最后一项常被遗忘却决定了对账能否自动完成。</p>\n<p>本节与相邻主题的边界：<strong>从哪个仓出</strong>在 <a href=\"warehouse-selection\">分仓选择与履约成本路由</a>；<strong>跨境的段如何交接</strong>在 <a href=\"cross-border-handoff\">跨境头程→清关→尾程交接</a>；<strong>轨迹如何归一化</strong>在 <a href=\"../tracking-eta/tracking-aggregation\">多承运商轨迹归一化聚合</a>；<strong>故障时如何切换</strong>在 <a href=\"../reverse-global/carrier-failover\">承运商故障切换与改派</a>。本文专注接入层与比价选型的内部机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;内部运单请求&lt;br/&gt;ShipRequest&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;承运商注册表&lt;br/&gt;能力 + 优先级&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;能力过滤&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;不支持带电&quot;| X[&quot;剔除&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;候选承运商&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;并发询价&lt;br/&gt;RateRequest&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;运价归一化&lt;br/&gt;计价口径统一&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;时效归一化&lt;br/&gt;承诺分位数&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;评分与选型&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;适配器&lt;br/&gt;Carrier Adapter&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;承运商 API&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;运单 + 面单&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"内部运单请求&lt;br/&gt;ShipRequest\"] --&gt; B[\"承运商注册表&lt;br/&gt;能力 + 优先级\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"能力过滤\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"不支持带电\"| X[\"剔除\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"候选承运商\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"并发询价&lt;br/&gt;RateRequest\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"运价归一化&lt;br/&gt;计价口径统一\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"时效归一化&lt;br/&gt;承诺分位数\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"评分与选型\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"适配器&lt;br/&gt;Carrier Adapter\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"承运商 API\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"运单 + 面单\"]</pre><p><code>F</code> 这一步是整个比价链条里技术上最容易出错、业务上最影响结果的一环：<strong>不同承运商的报价口径完全不同</strong>，不归一化就没法比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运价归一化-让报价可比\">运价归一化：让报价可比</h2><p>承运商的运价单是一份充满条件的分段函数。要做比价，必须把每份报价折算到<strong>同一个可比的量</strong>：在给定时效承诺下的全包成本。主要的口径差异有六类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异项</th>\n<th>各承运商的常见做法</th>\n<th>归一化目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计费重量</td>\n<td><code>max(实重, 体积重)</code>，体积除数 5000 / 6000 不等</td>\n<td>用统一的体积重公式重算，用实际包装尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首重续重</td>\n<td>0.5kg 首重 + 0.5kg 续重 / 1kg 首重 + 1kg 续重</td>\n<td>折算为「本单总运费」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>燃油附加</td>\n<td>按月公布百分比，乘在基础运费上</td>\n<td>用当月燃油率折算进总价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏远附加</td>\n<td>按邮编库判定，另有按重量档</td>\n<td>用统一的偏远邮编库判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旺季附加</td>\n<td>特定日期区间加价</td>\n<td>用发货日期判定是否命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尺寸附加</td>\n<td>超长/超重/异形加价</td>\n<td>用实际包装尺寸判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>归一化后的目标量是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>all-in</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>bill</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>remote</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>size</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{all-in}}(i) = \\Big( C_{\\text{base}}(i, W_{\\text{bill}}) \\cdot (1 + f_i) + A_{\\text{remote}}(i, d) + A_{\\text{peak}}(i, t) + A_{\\text{size}}(i, p) \\Big) \\cdot (1 + m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all-in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remote</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">size</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>bill</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>vol</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{bill}} = \\max(W_{\\text{actual}}, \\text{vol}(p)/D_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">vol</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是按承运商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的除数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算的计费重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是燃油率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mo>∗</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1757em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是各类附加，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是加价率（若是代理渠道）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是承运商属性，所以<strong>统一计费重并不等于统一公式</strong>——必须用各自的除数。</p>\n<p>比价必须把这些算清楚，而不是比较承运商返回的 <code>total</code> 字段。原因有三：<strong>（1）</strong> 承运商返回的报价经常不含燃油与附加，最终账单更高；<strong>（2）</strong> 只有拆解到分量，你才能回答「这家为什么贵」这个运营问题；<strong>（3）</strong> 对账时你需要一个自己算出的应付款作为比对基准，否则只能被动接受账单。承运商返回价与自算价的差异本身就是重要指标——差异持续变大通常意味着承运商改了价目表而你没同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效归一化与承诺分层\">时效归一化与承诺分层</h2><p>报价之外，比价还必须比较时效，而各家对时效的表达差异同样巨大：有的给一个日期区间，有的给天数，有的给「工作日」定义（不同国家的工作日不同），有的只给服务等级名称（Economy / Standard / Express）而不给数字。归一化的目标是把它们都变成<strong>到达时间的分位数估计</strong>。</p>\n<p>工程上有两种做法，应该组合使用：</p>\n<p><strong>基于承运商承诺的保守映射。</strong> 把服务等级映射为内部时效档位，用承运商公布的天数上限作为 P90 的代理。简单可靠但保守，会系统性高估时效。</p>\n<p><strong>基于历史实测的统计估计。</strong> 用本系统过去对这家承运商、这条线路的实际到达时间做分布估计，取分位数。这需要足够的样本量，且必须按线路（起运地-目的地）而非全局统计，因为同一家承运商在不同线路上的表现可能天差地别。</p>\n<p>组合方式是：<strong>冷启动用承诺映射，样本充足后切换到实测分布，并且持续监控两者的偏离</strong>。偏离大说明要么承运商的承诺不实，要么你的某条线路出了特殊问题，两者都值得关注。分位数预估与 <a href=\"../tracking-eta/eta-prediction\">配送时效预估模型</a> 共享方法论，区别在于这里的粒度是承运商-线路，那里的粒度是单个包裹。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型的评分与业务约束\">选型的评分与业务约束</h2><p>把归一化后的成本与时效组合，得到与选仓类似但输入不同的评分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>all-in</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>promise</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score}(i) = C_{\\text{all-in}}(i) + \\alpha \\cdot \\max\\!\\big(0, q_{90}(T_i) - T_{\\text{promise}}\\big) + \\gamma \\cdot \\text{Risk}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all-in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">90</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">promise</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第三项 <code>Risk</code> 是承运商抽象层里最容易被忽略、却在实际运营中价值最高的一项。它综合了：近期的事故率（丢件、破损、超时）、当前运力紧张程度、以及该承运商的业务连续性风险（是否单一枢纽、是否近期有罢工/爆仓）。在成本差异不大的情况下优先选低风险承运商，能显著降低第四章要处理的异常量。</p>\n<p>业务约束需要在评分之后作为<strong>否决权</strong>介入，因为它们常常不是可加权的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>业务约束</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品类资质（带电/液体）</td>\n<td>二值</td>\n<td>能力过滤阶段剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的地可达</td>\n<td>二值</td>\n<td>能力过滤阶段剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合约最低量</td>\n<td>累计约束</td>\n<td>达到最低量后可不选（保底单量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单一承运商占比上限</td>\n<td>风险约束</td>\n<td>超过上限后降权或剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战略合作承运商</td>\n<td>优先级</td>\n<td>加权而非强制，避免服务质量失控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户指定承运商</td>\n<td>硬约束</td>\n<td>直接锁定，跳过比价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>「单一承运商占比上限」值得单独说。</strong> 把 90% 的单量给一家最便宜的承运商，短期成本最优，但一旦它出问题（罢工、系统故障、爆仓），你没有可切换的运力，第四章的故障切换会变成不可能任务。正确做法是在比价评分里加入一个与当前占比相关的惩罚项，或设置硬上限，使单量分布保持在有韧性的区间。这与财务上的组合风险是同一个道理：<strong>便宜是有代价的，代价是集中度风险</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适配器设计与新承运商接入\">适配器设计与新承运商接入</h2><p>适配器（adapter）负责把内部模型翻译成某家承运商的 API 调用，并把响应翻译回来。设计原则：</p>\n<p><strong>适配器不承载业务逻辑。</strong> 它的职责只有协议翻译、鉴权、重试与错误映射。任何「选哪家」「何时重试到别家」的决策都在 adapter 之上。这样新增承运商不会引入新的业务分支。</p>\n<p><strong>错误必须映射成内部错误词汇。</strong> 承运商返回的错误码是它自己的语言（<code>E1042</code>、<code>INVALID_POSTAL</code>、<code>shipping address not serviceable</code>），必须映射到内部的一小组语义：地址不可达、超出服务范围、超重、资质不足、系统暂时不可用、参数错误。前四者不可重试（重试无用，应换承运商或改信息），后两者可重试或有条件重试。错误映射表的完备性直接决定了重试逻辑的健壮性——把「地址不可达」当成「系统不可用」而重试三次，浪费时间且必然失败。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等键必须在适配器层处理。</strong> 创建运单是有副作用的操作，超时后重试可能产生两张运单（双重计费）。适配器应把内部幂等键透传给支持幂等的承运商；不支持的，则必须先查询是否已创建成功（按业务单号查）再决定是否重试。这一条与 <a href=\"../fulfillment-order/waybill-lifecycle\">运单生命周期与状态机</a> 的幂等要求是同一条。</p>\n<p><strong>接入一家新承运商的标准检查单</strong>：（1）能力声明是否完整；（2）报价字段能否归一化到全包成本；（3）错误码是否已全部映射；（4）幂等语义是否明确；（5）轨迹事件格式与推送可靠性；（6）对账文件格式。这份清单应该固化在接入流程里，因为漏掉第 2 或第 6 项会在月末对账时才暴露，那时已经积累了整月的问题数据。（传统承运商对账仍以 EDI 为主流形态——美国 EDI 标准由 ANSI 于 1979 年特许的 ASC X12 维护，定义 300 余种交易集，覆盖运输与供应链；来源：Wikipedia, ANSI ASC X12, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ANSI_ASC_X12\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ANSI_ASC_X12</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"比价的时机与缓存\">比价的时机与缓存</h2><p>比价不能在每次创建运单时实时进行，那会把在线链路的延迟与承运商 API 可用性绑死。合理的做法是<strong>分层</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>离线预计算</strong>：每日批量拉取全量价目，归一化后落库。这是比价的主数据。</li>\n<li><strong>准实时校准</strong>：对于波动大或按需报价的承运商（如某些实时竞价平台），按小时或按需刷新。</li>\n<li><strong>在线兜底</strong>：仅当预计算数据缺失或明显过期时才实时询价，且有超时与降级（降级到上一份有效报价或到默认承运商）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个分层结构让在线比价变成一次本地查询，延迟可控，且承运商 API 故障不会阻塞发货。它的代价是报价可能过期——所以必须有<strong>报价新鲜度</strong>这个显式属性，并规定超过阈值的报价只能用于参考、不能作为最终计费依据。真实成本以对账为准，差异记入「运价估算误差」指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>建立内部承运商模型作为唯一抽象，把「接入第 N 家」变成配置工作；适配器只做协议翻译、鉴权、重试与错误映射，不承载业务逻辑。</li>\n<li>比价的关键是运价归一化：统一到「给定时效下的全包成本」，计费重按各承运商除数分别计算，燃油与各类附加必须显式折算。</li>\n<li>时效归一化为到达时间分位数；冷启动用承诺映射，样本充足后切换实测分布并监控偏离。</li>\n<li>评分 = 全包成本 + 超时惩罚 + 风险；业务约束（品类资质、目的地可达、单一承运商占比上限）作为否决权或降权，集中度风险必须主动控制。</li>\n<li>错误码映射到内部语义是重试逻辑的前提；创建运单必须幂等，超时后先查询再决定重试。</li>\n<li>比价分层：离线预计算为主、准实时校准为辅、在线实时仅作兜底，并记录报价新鲜度与估算误差。</li>\n<li>上游见 <a href=\"warehouse-selection\">分仓选择与履约成本路由</a>，跨境段交接见 <a href=\"cross-border-handoff\">跨境头程→清关→尾程交接</a>，故障时的切换见 <a href=\"../reverse-global/carrier-failover\">承运商故障切换与改派</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多承运商接入抽象与比价","id":"多承运商接入抽象与比价"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运价归一化：让报价可比","id":"运价归一化-让报价可比"},{"level":2,"text":"时效归一化与承诺分层","id":"时效归一化与承诺分层"},{"level":2,"text":"选型的评分与业务约束","id":"选型的评分与业务约束"},{"level":2,"text":"适配器设计与新承运商接入","id":"适配器设计与新承运商接入"},{"level":2,"text":"比价的时机与缓存","id":"比价的时机与缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分仓选择与履约成本路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/carrier-routing/warehouse-selection"},"next":{"title":"跨境头程→清关→尾程交接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/carrier-routing/cross-border-handoff"}}